{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786709645109697815,"compiled_state":{"alias":"earthen-flayed-baboon","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"66c5b4cfd74da6523dcd56bbde89906b505ed818321374e4c3bc00eba93e3ffc","event_uuid":"3d95b7a5-43e0-4e48-8463-a4f52f381c36","position":{"commit_sha":"35675e1fb72d4ba425b3b97f031a8613424acc07","position":"1786694355830665001-3d95b7a5-43e0-4e48-8463-a4f52f381c36"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"54a9cba808ddccccc42a51803516365d157900511b8aeadb033a78e22ed1fd01","event_uuid":"deda412d-c4b9-4ebb-ab1c-f01319fbb75e","position":{"commit_sha":"5a477740725da9a5c07e54f1c027026e6ec78de4","position":"1786694368670650001-deda412d-c4b9-4ebb-ab1c-f01319fbb75e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786694355830665001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"deda412d-c4b9-4ebb-ab1c-f01319fbb75e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3211-be4f-d4aa-4b5c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nFollow-up (fix b) discovered during creatable-foldable-arthropods (fix a, merged as a0fc8d43556 / Gerrit 1761). Fix (a) stopped the runaway-loop guard from counting memo-served repeats as loop evidence. A second, independent defect remains in the completion verifier's evidence-banking path: at SEARCH EXHAUSTION, `BOUNDED_FALLBACK_EVIDENCE` banks `met=false` — i.e. \"the criterion is unmet\" — when what the run actually established is only \"the search budget ran out before sufficient evidence was found\". Banking a hard negative from an exhausted search misattributes absence-of-evidence as evidence-of-absence: subsequent verifier passes (and the close gate) treat the criterion as affirmatively failed, producing false FAIL verdicts on tickets whose evidence exists but was not reached within the window.\n\n## Proposed fix\nMake the banked evidence TRI-STATE: `met=true`, `met=false` (a positive refutation was actually found), and `insufficient_evidence` (search exhausted / budget hit / window truncated without a determination). At search exhaustion, `BOUNDED_FALLBACK_EVIDENCE` must bank `insufficient_evidence`, never `met=false`. Downstream consumers (verdict composer, close gate messaging) must distinguish the two: `insufficient_evidence` yields an INDETERMINATE-style outcome with the existing remediation messaging (re-verify, widen scope, or operator-attest), not a FAIL.\n\n## Scope\n- The evidence-banking site(s) in the completion-verifier workflow where BOUNDED_FALLBACK_EVIDENCE is constructed at exhaustion.\n- The evidence schema/consumer seam that renders per-criterion verdicts from banked evidence.\n- Tests: a search-exhaustion run banks insufficient_evidence (not met=false); a genuine refutation still banks met=false; verdict rendering distinguishes the two.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] At search exhaustion, banked fallback evidence is `insufficient_evidence`, not `met=false`; checked by a new unit test.\n- [ ] A genuine positive refutation still banks `met=false` and still yields FAIL; checked by a guard test.\n- [ ] Verdict composition renders `insufficient_evidence` as indeterminate-with-remediation, not FAIL; checked by a rendering test.\n- [ ] `make lint` and `make typecheck` clean; lands via Gerrit (LLM-Review +1 AND Verified +1) before close.\n\n## Out of scope\nGuard/memo interaction (fix a, landed); verifier prompt changes; retry policy.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1d71-a76c-04f6-4642","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Completion verifier banks met=false at search exhaustion — should bank insufficient_evidence (tri-state)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3d95b7a5-43e0-4e48-8463-a4f52f381c36","deda412d-c4b9-4ebb-ab1c-f01319fbb75e"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786709645109697815,"uuid":"2c137337-3358-46be-a751-b81c131f150c"}